     "value": "Monomer. Interacts with ERCC6 (PubMed:26030138). Interacts with TPRN; TPRN interacts with a number of DNA damage response proteins, is recruited to sites of DNA damage and may play a role in DNA damage repair (PubMed:23213405)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
